WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
Nusumareta kako wo

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
Sagashitsuzukete

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Ore wa samayou

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
Mishiranu machi wo

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Honou no nioi shimitsuite

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Museru

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Sayonara wa itta hazu da

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
Wakareta hazu sa

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
Jigoku wo mireba

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
Kokoro ga kawaku

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Tatakai wa akita no sa

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
Sadame to areba

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Kokoro wo kimeru

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
Sottoshite oite kure

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Ashita ni

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Aa tsunagaru kyou gurai

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:29.460
Hey, what's wrong?

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:39.670
Clean Sweep

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:54.580
Attack! They're attacking the hangar!

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:04.250
Where are they? Over there!

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:29.750
Damn!

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:44.080
You...!

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:49.580
One left!

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:00.830
Monica?!

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:06.040
It's a woman!

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:12.330
Shit! After her!

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:14.460
Got away.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:17.040
Monica...

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:40.670
What're you laughing about?

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:42.460
Oh, it's you guys.

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:43.830
Are the ATs all right?

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:45.460
Yeah, they didn't get them.

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:46.290
Good.

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:47.830
What about the guerillas?

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:49.080
We got most of them.

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:52.790
'Cept one got away. Well, it was just a woman.

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:55.040
Man, look at it burn.

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:56.710
More profits for you.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:59.420
I don't suppose you hired them to attack us.

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:02.420
Enough with the bad jokes.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:05.580
Say, since you're all up,
why don't I buy you a drink?

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:07.040
Fine by me!

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:12.460
C'mon.

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:15.130
You don't just mean one drink, do you?

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:17.500
You think I'd treat you to more than one?

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:19.500
Meaning we have to buy the rest?

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:20.500
Naturally.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:28.210
But we have time till dawn

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:33.920
Once in a while, it's okay to wait

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:38.380
I'm feeling kind of sentimental today

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:42.830
It's okay, baby

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:46.040
I loved you once upon a time

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:43.960
Hi.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:46.380
Wanna try this beauty?

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.170
It's okay

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:51.750
I'll do as you ask

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:54.380
Pretty high-class hootch for a dump like this.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:54.170
Even if she comes

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:56.500
You can stay here with me

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:58.000
It was earmarked for the regular army.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:06:00.710
So long, baby

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.750
All that worthless army has going for it
is good booze.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:04.130
Is that really all you need?

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:05.250
Sure you wanna say that
around one of their officers?

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:06.580
Who do you mean?

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:09.170
It was easy to do

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:09.250
He hasn't told you?

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:11.920
Pol Potaria.

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:13.750
Even though we waited till dawn

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:17.250
If he's a Kummen army officer,
why's he a mercenary?

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:18.880
You're just too blunt

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:18.880
How should I know?

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:23.500
Although that adds a little color to you

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:23.500
Guys who become mercs have pasts
they don't like to talk about.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:27.880
So long, baby

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:27.330
Just like you. Huh, Chirico?

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:30.920
I loved you once upon a time

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:39.630
Thanks.

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:45.080
Did you like my song?

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:48.500
Say, why don't you buy me a drink
before my next set?

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:50.630
I'm sooo thirsty.

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:53.080
Order what you like.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.880
Sorry, but could you just leave me alone?

00:06:58.210 --> 00:06:59.960
Feelin' blown off, Coconna?

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:01.290
Why don't you dance with me?

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:02.710
Sorry, no.

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:04.630
Don't be so cold!

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:07.790
Looks like you're in a bad mood tonight.

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:09.420
Not really.

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:13.960
God, is he gloomy!

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:16.830
He looks like his girlfriend just dumped him.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.790
And speaking of lost loves...

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:28.000
you look like you're still thinking about that lady.

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:46.750
What's going on?

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.790
All personnel, assemble immediately!

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:55.460
Platoon three, formed up!

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:57.130
Platoon six, formed up!

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:59.170
All right, pipe down!

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:03.330
There's only one reason
I called this emergency assembly.

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:05.380
I'm referring to the guerillas' raid last night.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:12.210
Intelligence says they're operating from a base
80 klicks up the Munamera River,

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:14.380
in the village of Zonmu.

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:17.420
This time we're making a surprise attack.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:22.330
Zonmu is located in a maze
of mountainous terrain.

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:25.000
It will be investigated thoroughly.

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:28.130
If any guerilla infiltration is found...

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:30.460
they are to be utterly destroyed.

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:38.380
I'll now let Captain Kan Yu announce
the members of the special strike team.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:43.130
The main force of the special team
will consist of five ATs.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.750
I will be leading it. The other four ATs...

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:49.580
That's Veela territory. It's gonna be nasty.

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:52.500
So what? The bonus'll be that much higher.

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:53.920
Ru Shako!

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:57.000
Bully Kiderra!

00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:59.460
This one's gonna be riskier than normal.

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:03.380
I want a special bonus for this!
How much for each AT I take out?

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:04.380
What?!

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:11.130
But, sir...

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:19.040
Since this is a special mission,
General Gon Nu has agreed.

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:21.920
For every Veela AT destroyed,
you will receive 500 gildans.

00:09:22.380 --> 00:09:24.580
Fine. I'll take it.

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.670
That's if you make it back.

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:28.630
Next, Chirico Cuvie!

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:32.580
Finally, Pol Potaria.

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:36.460
You're a native, so I expect
you're familiar with these people.

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:39.130
We'll also be taking along
two companies of infantry.

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:42.000
I want everyone assembled
at the airfield in one hour!

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:58.790
If Zonmu is a guerilla stronghold,
then Veela ATs will probably show up.

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:01.420
And so may she, as well.

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:22.710
This is bomber group 8.

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:25.670
Zonmu spotted. Beginning strike!

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:52.170
Captain! We're attacking before even seeing
if there are any guerillas in there?!

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.750
And what if some should
open fire from the ground?

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:58.880
If we die because we didn't do our job
all our work will be for nothing.

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:01.540
But there are innocent women
and children down there!

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:03.210
You should be thankful!

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:06.920
We're sweeping this jungle clear
to protect you people!

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:11.130
Nevermind. Just leave some Veela ATs for us!

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:13.630
Target point spotted!

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:16.460
All right! Begin the operation!

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.920
Go on, move it!

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:20.040
Go!

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:44.170
Is the chief of this village here?

00:12:46.580 --> 00:12:50.290
Right here, sir. What's the meaning of this?

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:53.500
By order of the military,
this village is being investigated.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.880
We believe this is a guerilla base.

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:58.630
Guerillas? That's ridiculous!

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:02.830
We are all peaceful followers of the god Van Nu.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:06.750
Unfortunately, I don't take people at their word.

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:11.380
Hey!

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:13.670
Where are the Veela ATs!

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:15.000
Tell us the truth!

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:20.580
Talk!

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:26.420
What are you doing?

00:13:26.420 --> 00:13:30.330
Quiet! We're just making sure
nobody can run from us.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:34.330
This is a warning!
Anyone who runs gets shot on the spot!

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:38.330
Okay, I want one company
to search all the houses.

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:40.500
I know they're hiding weapons here.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:41.880
Get looking for them!

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:42.880
Yes, sir!

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:50.500
Were these seemingly peaceful villagers Veela?

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:52.580
I couldn't believe it.

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:56.080
But that may be what makes them
proper guerillas.

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:37.330
So, you were still hiding, huh?

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:46.580
Reporting, sir!

00:14:46.580 --> 00:14:50.210
Aside from a woman we found hiding,
we found nothing suspicious.

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:56.420
All right.

00:14:56.710 --> 00:14:58.710
You see our village is empty.

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:01.420
Now please go and leave us quickly.

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:04.130
All we've cleared are your buildings.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:06.790
Now we put your bodies to the test.

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:08.330
You what?

00:15:08.710 --> 00:15:11.170
One by one, slowly.

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:18.000
Van Nu's divine soldiers are descending from
Heaven to smite you with their hammers of steel!

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:21.500
We do not fear you! Do what you will to us!

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:24.580
Fine. We can fight them if they ever show up.

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:26.920
Make sure they can't run!

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:32.630
All those I call will come forward.

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:34.210
First, the chief.

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:37.420
That big guy.

00:15:39.130 --> 00:15:41.790
And... that young guy, too.

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:48.000
You too, grandpa. C'mon!

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:58.170
Okay. There'll be one round in this gun.

00:15:58.170 --> 00:16:00.170
You have a one-in-six chance.

00:16:00.170 --> 00:16:02.750
If you don't want to do it, then tell me the truth.

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:13.130
Oh, you'll wanna talk soon enough.

00:16:14.130 --> 00:16:15.790
It's Monica, all right.

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:21.210
This should make a great finale.

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:30.670
Stop this, please!

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:33.210
Shut up! If you want this to stop, then talk!

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:35.540
Otherwise, you all die!

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:40.500
We begin. The chief goes first.

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:17.750
Next!

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:20.960
Next!

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:24.920
No!

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:28.250
Such bad manners. Come on!

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:31.500
Too bad, but nobody gets to run away.

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:36.290
That's the way, kid! Take it like a man!

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:53.920
The odds are now one-in-two.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.330
C'mon, you want to live.

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:58.210
Just admit the guerillas are in this village.

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:03.250
Stop it!

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:08.380
Don't go easy on them just because
they're your countrymen!

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:09.630
A guerilla's a guerilla!

00:18:10.290 --> 00:18:12.630
It's because they're my countrymen
that I understand!

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:14.080
Come on, don't you recognize me?

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:21.580
Potaria!

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:23.920
I thought so!

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:25.330
You know her?

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:26.460
A childhood friend.

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:28.670
My, how convenient.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:32.960
Potaria, since she's your old friend,
have her tell us about the guerillas.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:35.210
Monica was a good, gentle girl!

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:37.580
She'd never live in a rebel village!

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:40.170
Monica, I volunteered to become a mercenary

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:43.000
because I believed in getting
Kummen industrialized quickly.

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.880
Because the army wasn't doing enough!

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:50.330
I can't believe you'd side with the Veela,
when all they want is to deny Kummen its future!

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:53.330
Potaria, that's just a sick illusion.

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:54.420
What?!

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:58.880
Kummen has to return to the ideals of
the great King Branjelman the first!

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:00.750
That's the real illusion!

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:03.960
So, you're working for the guerillas.

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:07.130
Monica! Say you aren't one of them!

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:11.330
I live as I've chosen to live.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:15.540
Saying what you want
would rob my life of any meaning.

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:18.210
I'd sooner choose death.

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.920
Which ideal was the illusion?

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:26.670
Everything I'd fought for until now
seemed just as illusory.

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:31.130
Monica!

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:38.170
You...! Are you trying to ruin this?!

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:40.670
That's more than enough of your little gun game.

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:43.630
There are other ways to look for guerillas.

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:45.710
And what might those be?

00:19:45.710 --> 00:19:47.170
Ways like this!

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:51.500
If the people won't answer,
let's ask God where they are!

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:02.790
There they are! Kill them all!

00:20:14.670 --> 00:20:16.380
There's more coming from that way?

00:20:20.290 --> 00:20:22.000
Hurry! Hurry!

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:39.880
Get 'em!

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:28.670
Fyana!

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:50.210
Fyana, if you're a PS, you must recognize this!

00:21:50.210 --> 00:21:52.420
Melkian military signaling.

00:22:02.790 --> 00:22:04.380
It's me! Chirico!

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:05.960
You can't have forgotten.

00:22:05.960 --> 00:22:08.040
Why are you fighting me, Fyana?

00:22:08.380 --> 00:22:09.420
Stop it!

00:22:13.080 --> 00:22:15.540
You know who I am, don't you, Fyana?

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:36.540
You're not... Who are you?!

00:22:38.170 --> 00:22:39.540
So, you're Chirico.

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.710
Next Episode

00:22:55.920 --> 00:22:57.960
Is the love he sees merely an illusion?

00:22:57.960 --> 00:23:00.630
Is the barreness in his heart from living a fantasy?

00:23:00.630 --> 00:23:06.000
Any soldier knows that the ideals he sees
at the war's end are mere illusions.

00:23:06.380 --> 00:23:12.250
But that which makes the eyes flash and
the lips tremble must be real, somehow.

00:23:12.250 --> 00:23:15.130
Perhaps everything in this world is illusory.

00:23:15.420 --> 00:23:18.130
But then, who is it he sees before his own eyes?

00:23:18.460 --> 00:23:20.460
Next time, "Reunion"

00:23:19.630 --> 00:23:24.290
Reunion

00:23:19.630 --> 00:23:24.290
Next Time

00:23:20.460 --> 00:23:22.750
A dramatic enemy shows his fangs.

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.000
Samishii toki mo

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.540
Kanashii toki mo

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:55.920
Itsumo anata ga me ni ukabu

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.960
Hitori no toki mo

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.380
Aitai toki mo

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:09.630
Itsumo anata wa mune no naka

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.130
Tooku hanarete itemo

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.540
Tatoe wakarete itemo

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.040
Kono yo no hikari to tomo ni mabushiku

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.380
Ano hi no anata ga...
